      "id": "097f50c6d53e917d",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 32,
      "quote": "These structures define a group of related fields that MUST hold certain properties. Wherever these structures are referenced in this specification, implementations MUST ensure that all properties of a structure's fields are upheld.",
