    },
    {
      "id": "c6cb9a426a4bf1e0",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 35,
      "quote": "The encryption materials request MUST include the following: - [Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context) - The encryption context provided MAY be empty. - [Commitment Policy](./commitment-policy.md#supported-commitment-policy-enum)",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/cmms.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "encryption-materials-request",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "f69dadbcb65346d3",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 49,
      "quote": "The encryption request MAY include the following: - [Algorithm Suite Id](algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suite-id) - Required Encryption Context Keys - a set of strings. - Max Plaintext Length - This value represents the maximum length of the plaintext to be encrypted using the returned materials. The length of the plaintext to be encrypted MUST not be larger than this value.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/cmms.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "encryption-materials-request",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb278b9d0450614b",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 78,
      "quote": "The decrypt materials request MUST include the following: - [Algorithm Suite Id](algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suite-id) - [Commitment Policy](./commitment-policy.md#supported-commitment-policy-enum) - [Encrypted Data Keys](structures.md#encrypted-data-keys) - [Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context) - The encryption context provided MAY be empty.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/cmms.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials-request",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9a715a96a7deee7",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 100,
      "quote": "The decrypt materials request MAY include the following: - [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context)",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/cmms.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials-request",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "7862e10fb10ac857",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 15,
      "quote": "Cryptographic materials cache (CMC) is used by the [caching cryptographic materials manager (CMM)](caching-cmm.md) to store cryptographic materials for reuse. This document describes the interface that all CMCs MUST implement.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/cryptographic-materials-cache.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "overview",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "4d6e995c48490225",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 26,
      "quote": "This operation MUST NOT return the inserted cache entry.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/cryptographic-materials-cache.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "put-cache-entry",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b49cb9a1066705e",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 41,
      "quote": "The cache entry MUST include all [usage metadata](#usage-metadata) since this information can not be updated after the put operation.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/cryptographic-materials-cache.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "put-cache-entry",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "20511d5b9d3dc2cd",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 62,
      "quote": "A cache entry represents an entry in the cryptographic materials cache and MUST have the following information. - [Materials](#materials) - [Creation Time](#creation-time) - [Expiry Time](#expiry-time) - [Usage Metadata](#usage-metadata)",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/cryptographic-materials-cache.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "cache-entry",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "3c517aabbf3a9880",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 76,
      "quote": "Each cache entry has a time-to-live (TTL) that represents a point in time at which the cache entry MUST be considered invalid.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/cryptographic-materials-cache.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "time-to-live-ttl",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f411d301606e146",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 153,
      "quote": "On initialization of the local CMC, the caller MUST provide the following: - [Entry Capacity](#entry-capacity) The local CMC MUST also define the following: - [Entry Pruning Tail Size](#entry-pruning-tail-size)",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/cryptographic-materials-cache.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/local-cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "initialization",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "4891d9f3c51806a6",
