      "line": 138,
      "quote": "The value of keys in this list MUST be kept secret.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/structures.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "symmetric-signing-keys",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "4ec16affe141d882",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 144,
      "quote": "The encryption context is a key-value mapping of arbitrary, non-secret, UTF-8 encoded strings. It is used during [encryption](../client-apis/encrypt.md) and [decryption](../client-apis/decrypt.md) to provide additional authenticated data (AAD).",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/structures.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "structure-1",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "261ed1d9ff6b97d7",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 71,
      "quote": "The Material Providers Library MUST provide an ENUM that is the super set of all the [supported format algorithm suites enum](#supported-format-algorithm-suites-enum) called the Algorithm Suite ENUM.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/Model/suites.smithy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md",
      "target_section": "supported-algorithm-suites-enum",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "9ae8c7dddcab4885",
