    },
    {
      "id": "d609621928069150",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 391,
      "quote": "If this key is not present in the encryption context, the operation MUST fail without returning any decryption materials.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/DefaultCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "71560fff386d9e41",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 396,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite does not contain a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm), but the encryption context includes the reserved `aws-crypto-public-key` key, the operation MUST fail without returning any decryption materials.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/DefaultCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "bbbb3375d65325d4",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 409,
      "quote": "The request MUST fail if the algorithm suite on the request is not supported by the [commitment policy](./commitment-policy.md#supported-commitment-policy-enum) on the request.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/DefaultCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "fda29cbb12e415d6",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 418,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite contains a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm), the default CMM MUST extract the verification key from the encryption context under the reserved `aws-crypto-public-key` key.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/DefaultCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef26c1809e28b83e",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 434,
      "quote": "- If the decrypt materials request contains an algorithm suite, the decryption materials returned SHOULD contain the same algorithm suite.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/DefaultCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "2f3785e13f2e089d",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 439,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite obtained from the decryption request contains a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm), the decryption materials MUST include the [signature verification key](structures.md#verification-key).",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/DefaultCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "6b609a80efe855af",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 446,
      "quote": "- This set MUST include all keys added to the decryption materials encryption context that existed in the [decrypt materials request's](#decrypt-materials-request) reproduced encryption context but did not exist in the [decrypt materials request's](#decrypt-materials-request) encryption context.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/DefaultCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "944c017419a47d55",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 460,
      "quote": "On each call to Decrypt Materials, the default CMM MUST make a call to its [keyring's](#keyring) [On Decrypt](keyring-interface.md#ondecrypt) operation.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/DefaultCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "553f9140cc36183f",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 466,
      "quote": "The default CMM MUST obtain the Plaintext Data Key from the On Decrypt response and include it in the decrypt materials returned.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/DefaultCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e293acae1f0444e",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 85,
      "quote": "The encryption materials returned MUST include the following:",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec7b2680ce7f9060",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 90,
      "quote": "The CMM MUST ensure that the encryption materials returned are valid. - The encryption materials returned MUST follow the specification for [encryption-materials](structures.md#encryption-materials). - The value of the plaintext data key MUST be non-NULL. - The plaintext data key length MUST be equal to the [key derivation input length](algorithm-suites.md#key-derivation-input-length). - The encrypted data keys list MUST contain at least one encrypted data key. - If the algorithm suite contains a signing algorithm, the encryption materials returned MUST include the generated signing key. - For every key in [Required Encryption Context Keys](structures.md#required-encryption-context-keys) there MUST be a matching key in the [Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context-1).",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "79754d8edc0a646c",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 104,
      "quote": "- The [Required Encryption Context Keys](structures.md#required-encryption-context-keys) MUST be a super set of the Required Encryption Context Keys in the [encryption materials request](#encryption-materials-request).",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "9e2019bc2d0ea90b",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 112,
      "quote": "The encryption context on the [encryption materials request](./cmm-interface.md#encryption-materials-request) MUST contain a value for every key in the configured [required encryption context keys](#required-encryption-context-keys) or this request MUST fail.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/required-encryption-context-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "b647cd3cbddda3b9",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 121,
      "quote": "The Required Encryption Context CMM MUST attempt to obtain [encryption materials](./structures.md#encryption-materials) by making a call to the [underlying CMM's](#underlying-cryptographic-materials-manager) [Get Encryption Materials](cmm-interface.md#get-encryption-materials).",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/required-encryption-context-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "22ba230112c68216",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 133,
      "quote": "All configured [required encryption context keys](#required-encryption-context-keys) MUST exist in the required encryption context keys of the [encryption materials request](./cmm-interface.md#encryption-materials-request) to the [underlying CMM's](#underlying-cryptographic-materials-manager).",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/required-encryption-context-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "f57e8ae42cffbdc6",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 146,
      "quote": "The obtained [encryption materials](./structures.md#encryption-materials) MUST have all configured [required encryption context keys](#required-encryption-context-keys) in it's [required encryption context keys](./structures.md#required-encryption-context-keys).",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/required-encryption-context-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b39d92a27de2e00",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 210,
      "quote": "The CMM MUST validate the [Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context) by comparing it to the customer supplied [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context) in [decrypt materials request](#decrypt-materials-request). For every key that exists in both [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context) and [Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context), the values MUST be equal or the operation MUST fail.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f73604d94dc2908",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 221,
      "quote": "- All key-value pairs that exist in [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context) but do not exist in encryption context on the [decrypt materials request](#decrypt-materials-request) SHOULD be appended to the decryption materials.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "93917259369edcc3",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 228,
      "quote": "The reproduced encryption context on the [decrypt materials request](./cmm-interface.md#decrypt-materials-request) MUST contain a value for every key in the configured [required encryption context keys](#required-encryption-context-keys) or this request MUST fail.",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/required-encryption-context-cmm.md",
