      "quote": "The Required Encryption Context CMM MUST attempt to obtain [decryption materials](./structures.md#decryption-materials) by making a call to the [underlying CMM's](#underlying-cryptographic-materials-manager) [decrypt materials](cmm-interface.md#decrypt-materials) interface with the unchanged [decrypt materials request](./cmm-interface.md#decrypt-materials-request).",
      "source": "AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/dafny/AwsCryptographicMaterialProviders/src/CMMs/RequiredEncryptionContextCMM.dfy",
