      "target_section": "interface",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "OnDecrypt MUST take [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials) and\na list of [encrypted data keys](structures.md#encrypted-data-key) as input.\n",
      "id": "40933d529f002345",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 88,
      "quote": "OnDecrypt MUST take [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials) and a list of [encrypted data keys](structures.md#encrypted-data-key) as input.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the decryption materials already contain a plaintext data key,\nOnDecrypt MUST fail\nand MUST NOT modify the [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials).\n",
      "id": "6c5f3c994525172b",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 95,
      "quote": "If the decryption materials already contain a plaintext data key, OnDecrypt MUST fail and MUST NOT modify the [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST attempt to serialize the [decryption materials'](structures.md#decryption-materials)\n[encryption context](structures.md#encryption-context-1) according to the [encryption context serialization specification](structures.md#serialization).\n",
      "id": "c83da62f3d6f08bf",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 103,
      "quote": "The keyring MUST attempt to serialize the [decryption materials'](structures.md#decryption-materials) [encryption context](structures.md#encryption-context-1) according to the [encryption context serialization specification](structures.md#serialization).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the keyring cannot serialize the encryption context, OnDecrypt MUST fail.\n",
      "id": "cc47b71496198213",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 110,
      "quote": "If the keyring cannot serialize the encryption context, OnDecrypt MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The set of encrypted data keys MUST first be filtered to match this keyring’s configuration.\n",
      "id": "5c9cc251586d8e85",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 116,
      "quote": "The set of encrypted data keys MUST first be filtered to match this keyring’s configuration.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- MUST first verify that the uncompressed deserialized sender's public key\nand the uncompressed deserialized recipient's public key match the public\nkeys configured on the keyring.\n",
      "id": "61469b891b3cd1dc",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 122,
      "quote": "- MUST first verify that the uncompressed deserialized sender's public key and the uncompressed deserialized recipient's public key match the public keys configured on the keyring.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- The deserialized version value in the [key provider information](#key-provider-information) MUST match `0x01`.\n",
      "id": "3a0ad97ec2df7165",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 130,
      "quote": "- The deserialized version value in the [key provider information](#key-provider-information) MUST match `0x01`.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- The [ciphertext](#ciphertext) and [key provider information](#key-provider-information) MUST be successfully deserialized.\n",
      "id": "c84b8d1e2803b373",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 136,
      "quote": "- The [ciphertext](#ciphertext) and [key provider information](#key-provider-information) MUST be successfully deserialized.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- The key provider ID of the encrypted data key MUST have a value equal to the UTF8 encoded strings `raw-ecdh` OR `aws-kms-ecdh`.\n",
      "id": "acc53df814b2f6ba",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 142,
      "quote": "- The key provider ID of the encrypted data key MUST have a value equal to the UTF8 encoded strings `raw-ecdh` OR `aws-kms-ecdh`.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- The [authentication tag length](#authentication-tag-length) obtained from the key provider information MUST have a value equal to 16 bytes.\n",
      "id": "7b6c33a3c85bf810",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 148,
      "quote": "- The [authentication tag length](#authentication-tag-length) obtained from the key provider information MUST have a value equal to 16 bytes.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For each encrypted data key in the filtered set, one at a time, the OnDecrypt MUST attempt to decrypt the data key.\n",
      "id": "c2e1b0a668365823",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 154,
      "quote": "For each encrypted data key in the filtered set, one at a time, the OnDecrypt MUST attempt to decrypt the data key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If this attempt results in an error, then these errors MUST be collected.\n",
      "id": "50be267dcbe5d282",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 160,
      "quote": "If this attempt results in an error, then these errors MUST be collected.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "To attempt to decrypt a particular [encrypted data key](./structures.md#encrypted-data-key),\nOnDecrypt MUST attempt to deserialize the [serialized ciphertext](#ciphertext)\nto obtain:\n",
      "id": "5c34efc99ddc3114",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 166,
      "quote": "To attempt to decrypt a particular [encrypted data key](./structures.md#encrypted-data-key), OnDecrypt MUST attempt to deserialize the [serialized ciphertext](#ciphertext) to obtain:",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the keyring is unable to deserialize this information then an error MUST be collected\nand the next encrypted data key in the filtered set MUST be attempted.\n",
      "id": "7fded9bc99bd1e5d",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 174,
      "quote": "If the keyring is unable to deserialize this information then an error MUST be collected and the next encrypted data key in the filtered set MUST be attempted.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST derive the shared secret\nby calling [AWS KMS DeriveSharedSecret]()\nwith a request constructed as follows:\n",
      "id": "fc540e0009bd10e5",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 181,
      "quote": "The keyring MUST derive the shared secret by calling [AWS KMS DeriveSharedSecret]() with a request constructed as follows:",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- `KeyId` MUST be the configured AWS KMS key identifier in the schema\n",
      "id": "bbf0b2ee6d77038d",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 189,
      "quote": "- `KeyId` MUST be the configured AWS KMS key identifier in the schema",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- `PublicKey` MUST be the configured Recipient Public Key on the schema\n",
      "id": "ed7e6781d9170726",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 195,
      "quote": "- `PublicKey` MUST be the configured Recipient Public Key on the schema",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- `KeyAgreementAlgorithm` MUST be \"ECDH\"\n",
      "id": "4811e577274de98e",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 201,
      "quote": "- `KeyAgreementAlgorithm` MUST be \"ECDH\"",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- `GrantTokens` MUST be this keyring's [grant tokens](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/developerguide/concepts.html#grant_token).\n",
      "id": "181c419b082c7a68",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 207,
      "quote": "- `GrantTokens` MUST be this keyring's [grant tokens](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/developerguide/concepts.html#grant_token).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the call to KMS DeriveSharedSecret fails, an error MUST be collected\nand the next encrypted data key in the filtered set MUST be attempted.\n",
      "id": "0bc0ba6f326ff103",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 213,
      "quote": "If the call to KMS DeriveSharedSecret fails, an error MUST be collected and the next encrypted data key in the filtered set MUST be attempted.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST derive a shared wrapping key according\nto the construction outlined by the [key agreement schemas](./key-agreement-schemas.md#key-derivation)\n",
      "id": "cc6f91e8e29029f9",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 220,
      "quote": "The keyring MUST derive a shared wrapping key according to the construction outlined by the [key agreement schemas](./key-agreement-schemas.md#key-derivation)",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the Key Derivation step fails, then an error MUST be collected\nand the next encrypted data key in the filtered set MUST be attempted.\n",
      "id": "2dd45a078b58f8d6",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 227,
      "quote": "If the Key Derivation step fails, then an error MUST be collected and the next encrypted data key in the filtered set MUST be attempted.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If they Key Derivation step succeeds it MUST produce\nkeying material with a length of 64 bytes.\n",
      "id": "0e96b9ff3aaebd86",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 234,
      "quote": "If they Key Derivation step succeeds it MUST produce keying material with a length of 64 bytes.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST use the first 32 bytes as the Commitment Key.\n",
      "id": "e93099f56096e2ea",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 241,
      "quote": "The keyring MUST use the first 32 bytes as the Commitment Key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST use the last 32 bytes as the Shared Wrapping Key.\n",
      "id": "c44be1b73a4232bc",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 247,
      "quote": "The keyring MUST use the last 32 bytes as the Shared Wrapping Key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST check that the calculated Commitment Key\nfrom the key derivation step is equal to the deserialized commitment key\nfound in the encrypted data key.\n",
      "id": "43ed96077249cb2f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 253,
      "quote": "The keyring MUST check that the calculated Commitment Key from the key derivation step is equal to the deserialized commitment key found in the encrypted data key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "This check MUST be a constant time check.\n",
      "id": "2069003d6011471c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 261,
      "quote": "This check MUST be a constant time check.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the commitment keys DO NOT match, then an error MUST be collected\nand the next encrypted data key in the filtered set MUST be attempted.\n",
      "id": "1039a64b6ba800ca",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 267,
      "quote": "If the commitment keys DO NOT match, then an error MUST be collected and the next encrypted data key in the filtered set MUST be attempted.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST perform data key unwrapping according to the [Data Key Unwrapping section](#data-key-unwrapping).\n",
      "id": "7b67301d88ef677a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 274,
      "quote": "The keyring MUST perform data key unwrapping according to the [Data Key Unwrapping section](#data-key-unwrapping).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-ecdh-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
