      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For each encrypted data key in the filtered set, one at a time, OnDecrypt MUST attempt to decrypt the encrypted data key.\n",
      "id": "ccbc3662909115ff",
