      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "To decrypt each encrypted data key in the filtered set, the hierarchical keyring MUST attempt\nto find the corresponding [branch key materials](../structures.md#branch-key-materials)\nfrom the underlying [cryptographic materials cache](../local-cryptographic-materials-cache.md).\n",
      "id": "df76b1914dacc746",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 94,
      "quote": "To decrypt each encrypted data key in the filtered set, the hierarchical keyring MUST attempt to find the corresponding [branch key materials](../structures.md#branch-key-materials) from the underlying [cryptographic materials cache](../local-cryptographic-materials-cache.md).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
