      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a cache entry is found and the entry's TTL has not expired, the hierarchical keyring MUST use those branch key materials for key unwrapping.\n",
      "id": "d334038903fa0557",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 109,
      "quote": "If a cache entry is found and the entry's TTL has not expired, the hierarchical keyring MUST use those branch key materials for key unwrapping.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a cache entry is not found or the cache entry is expired, the hierarchical keyring\nMUST attempt to obtain the branch key materials by calling the backing branch key\nstore specified in the [retrieve OnDecrypt branch key materials](#getitem-branch-keystore-ondecrypt) section.\n",
      "id": "761a0dbf7b777a8c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 115,
      "quote": "If a cache entry is not found or the cache entry is expired, the hierarchical keyring MUST attempt to obtain the branch key materials by calling the backing branch key store specified in the [retrieve OnDecrypt branch key materials](#getitem-branch-keystore-ondecrypt) section.",
