      "level": "Must",
      "line": 129,
      "quote": "- MUST unwrap the encrypted data key with the branch key materials according to the [branch key unwrapping](#branch-key-unwrapping) section.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a decryption succeeds, this keyring MUST\nadd the resulting plaintext data key to the decryption materials and return the modified materials.\n",
      "id": "94357759304b34fe",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 135,
      "quote": "If a decryption succeeds, this keyring MUST add the resulting plaintext data key to the decryption materials and return the modified materials.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If OnDecrypt fails to successfully decrypt any [encrypted data key](../structures.md#encrypted-data-key),\nthen it MUST yield an error that includes all the collected errors\nand MUST NOT modify the [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials).\n",
      "id": "1809b05856e7cd24",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 142,
      "quote": "If OnDecrypt fails to successfully decrypt any [encrypted data key](../structures.md#encrypted-data-key), then it MUST yield an error that includes all the collected errors and MUST NOT modify the [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "OnEncrypt MUST take [encryption materials](../structures.md#encryption-materials) as input.\n",
      "id": "6b0f6dc0477b554f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 42,
      "quote": "OnEncrypt MUST take [encryption materials](../structures.md#encryption-materials) as input.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the input [encryption materials](../structures.md#encryption-materials) do not contain a plaintext data key,\nOnEncrypt MUST generate a random plaintext data key, according to the key length defined in the [algorithm suite](../algorithm-suites.md#encryption-key-length).\n",
      "id": "6ccc9a803067670d",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 48,
      "quote": "If the input [encryption materials](../structures.md#encryption-materials) do not contain a plaintext data key, OnEncrypt MUST generate a random plaintext data key, according to the key length defined in the [algorithm suite](../algorithm-suites.md#encryption-key-length).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The process used to generate this random plaintext data key MUST use a secure source of randomness.\n",
      "id": "d0ccd0a54ffea6a3",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 55,
      "quote": "The process used to generate this random plaintext data key MUST use a secure source of randomness.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The hierarchical keyring MUST attempt to find [branch key materials](../structures.md#branch-key-materials)\nfrom the underlying [cryptographic materials cache](../local-cryptographic-materials-cache.md).\n",
      "id": "b4e762998bdc1b1a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 61,
      "quote": "The hierarchical keyring MUST attempt to find [branch key materials](../structures.md#branch-key-materials) from the underlying [cryptographic materials cache](../local-cryptographic-materials-cache.md).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The hierarchical keyring MUST use the formulas specified in [Appendix A](#appendix-a-cache-entry-identifier-formulas)\nto compute the [cache entry identifier](../cryptographic-materials-cache.md#cache-identifier).\n",
      "id": "66cc8c289633316f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 68,
      "quote": "The hierarchical keyring MUST use the formulas specified in [Appendix A](#appendix-a-cache-entry-identifier-formulas) to compute the [cache entry identifier](../cryptographic-materials-cache.md#cache-identifier).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a cache entry is found and the entry's TTL has not expired, the hierarchical keyring MUST use those branch key materials for key wrapping.\n",
      "id": "fc4459b01e7a12bd",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 75,
      "quote": "If a cache entry is found and the entry's TTL has not expired, the hierarchical keyring MUST use those branch key materials for key wrapping.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a cache entry is not found or the cache entry is expired, the hierarchical keyring MUST attempt to obtain the branch key materials\nby querying the backing branch keystore specified in the [retrieve OnEncrypt branch key materials](#query-branch-keystore-onencrypt) section.\n",
      "id": "dee15586436c06ac",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 81,
      "quote": "If a cache entry is not found or the cache entry is expired, the hierarchical keyring MUST attempt to obtain the branch key materials by querying the backing branch keystore specified in the [retrieve OnEncrypt branch key materials](#query-branch-keystore-onencrypt) section.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the keyring is not able to retrieve [branch key materials](../structures.md#branch-key-materials)\nthrough the underlying cryptographic materials cache or\nit no longer has access to them through the backing keystore, OnEncrypt MUST fail.\n",
      "id": "90cca074046cdf51",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 88,
      "quote": "If the keyring is not able to retrieve [branch key materials](../structures.md#branch-key-materials) through the underlying cryptographic materials cache or it no longer has access to them through the backing keystore, OnEncrypt MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- MUST wrap a data key with the branch key materials according to the [branch key wrapping](#branch-key-wrapping) section.\n",
      "id": "7ec3e02bc6d617a8",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 96,
      "quote": "- MUST wrap a data key with the branch key materials according to the [branch key wrapping](#branch-key-wrapping) section.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
