      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-hierarchical-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Otherwise, OnEncrypt MUST append a new [encrypted data key](../structures.md#encrypted-data-key)\nto the encrypted data key list in the [encryption materials](../structures.md#encryption-materials), constructed as follows:\n",
      "id": "e10fe92ff83c1073",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 109,
      "quote": "Otherwise, OnEncrypt MUST append a new [encrypted data key](../structures.md#encrypted-data-key) to the encrypted data key list in the [encryption materials](../structures.md#encryption-materials), constructed as follows:",
