      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For each encrypted data key in the filtered set, one at a time, the OnDecrypt MUST attempt to decrypt the data key.\n",
      "id": "a7c267bce22f3aee",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 85,
      "quote": "For each encrypted data key in the filtered set, one at a time, the OnDecrypt MUST attempt to decrypt the data key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If this attempt results in an error, then these errors MUST be collected.\n",
      "id": "26d1fbf0863302c7",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 91,
      "quote": "If this attempt results in an error, then these errors MUST be collected.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "To attempt to decrypt a particular [encrypted data key](../structures.md#encrypted-data-key),\nOnDecrypt MUST call [AWS KMS Decrypt](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/APIReference/API_Decrypt.html) with the configured AWS KMS client.\n",
      "id": "95f46867e6de2e31",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 97,
      "quote": "To attempt to decrypt a particular [encrypted data key](../structures.md#encrypted-data-key), OnDecrypt MUST call [AWS KMS Decrypt](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/APIReference/API_Decrypt.html) with the configured AWS KMS client.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "When calling [AWS KMS Decrypt](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/APIReference/API_Decrypt.html), the keyring MUST call with a request constructed as follows:\n",
      "id": "0b9a026fad741078",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 104,
      "quote": "When calling [AWS KMS Decrypt](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/APIReference/API_Decrypt.html), the keyring MUST call with a request constructed as follows:",
