      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- The length of the response’s `Plaintext` MUST equal the [key derivation input length](../algorithm-suites.md#key-derivation-input-length)\nspecified by the [algorithm suite](../algorithm-suites.md) included in the input [decryption materials](../structures.md#decryption-materials).\n",
      "id": "1c99c8e9797586c8",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 140,
      "quote": "- The length of the response’s `Plaintext` MUST equal the [key derivation input length](../algorithm-suites.md#key-derivation-input-length) specified by the [algorithm suite](../algorithm-suites.md) included in the input [decryption materials](../structures.md#decryption-materials).",
