      "target_section": "decrypt-data-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Additionally each provider info MUST be a [valid AWS KMS ARN](aws-kms-key-arn.md#a-valid-aws-kms-arn) with a resource type of `key`.\n",
      "id": "a5247e7077c41612",
      "level": "Must",
