      "quote": "The input MUST be the same as the [Master Key Provider Get Master Key](../master-key-provider-interface.md#get-master-key) interface.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider/get-master-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider.md",
      "target_section": "get-master-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The function MUST only provide master keys if the input provider id equals `aws-kms`.\n",
      "id": "cf14d4bf8fd85ab7",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 47,
      "quote": "The function MUST only provide master keys if the input provider id equals `aws-kms`.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider/get-master-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider.md",
      "target_section": "get-master-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "In strict mode, the requested AWS KMS key ARN MUST match a member of the configured key ids\nby using [AWS KMS MRK Match for Decrypt](aws-kms-mrk-match-for-decrypt.md#implementation)\notherwise this function MUST error.\n",
      "id": "201de3d78950ef32",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 53,
      "quote": "In strict mode, the requested AWS KMS key ARN MUST match a member of the configured key ids by using [AWS KMS MRK Match for Decrypt](aws-kms-mrk-match-for-decrypt.md#implementation) otherwise this function MUST error.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider/get-master-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider.md",
      "target_section": "get-master-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "In discovery mode, the requested AWS KMS key identifier MUST be a well formed AWS KMS ARN.\n",
      "id": "46bf87b3da366c93",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 61,
      "quote": "In discovery mode, the requested AWS KMS key identifier MUST be a well formed AWS KMS ARN.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider/get-master-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider.md",
      "target_section": "get-master-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "In discovery mode if a discovery filter is configured\nthe requested AWS KMS key ARN’s `partition` MUST match the discovery filter’s `partition`\nand the AWS KMS key ARN’s `account` MUST exist in the discovery filter’s account id set.\n",
      "id": "f100503e2f748779",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 67,
      "quote": "In discovery mode if a discovery filter is configured the requested AWS KMS key ARN’s `partition` MUST match the discovery filter’s `partition` and the AWS KMS key ARN’s `account` MUST exist in the discovery filter’s account id set.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider/get-master-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider.md",
      "target_section": "get-master-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the requested AWS KMS key identifier is not a well formed ARN\nthe AWS Region MUST be the configured default region this SHOULD be obtained from the AWS SDK.\n",
      "id": "48a94caa0805db12",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 75,
      "quote": "If the requested AWS KMS key identifier is not a well formed ARN the AWS Region MUST be the configured default region this SHOULD be obtained from the AWS SDK.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider/get-master-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider.md",
      "target_section": "get-master-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Otherwise if the requested AWS KMS key identifier is [identified as a multi-Region key](aws-kms-key-arn.md#identifying-an-aws-kms-multi-region-key),\nthen AWS Region MUST be the region from the AWS KMS key ARN stored in the provider info from the encrypted data key.\n",
      "id": "10032b3ec81bdfb8",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 82,
      "quote": "Otherwise if the requested AWS KMS key identifier is [identified as a multi-Region key](aws-kms-key-arn.md#identifying-an-aws-kms-multi-region-key), then AWS Region MUST be the region from the AWS KMS key ARN stored in the provider info from the encrypted data key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider/get-master-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider.md",
      "target_section": "get-master-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Otherwise if the mode is discovery then the AWS Region MUST be the discovery MRK region.\n",
      "id": "8aaa6d33b5b77a39",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 89,
      "quote": "Otherwise if the mode is discovery then the AWS Region MUST be the discovery MRK region.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider/get-master-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider.md",
      "target_section": "get-master-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Finally if the provider info is [identified as a multi-Region key](aws-kms-key-arn.md#identifying-an-aws-kms-multi-region-key)\nthe AWS Region MUST be the region from the AWS KMS key in the configured key ids matched to\nthe requested AWS KMS key by using [AWS KMS MRK Match for Decrypt](aws-kms-mrk-match-for-decrypt.md#implementation).\n",
      "id": "7ed84e9f09065e48",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 95,
      "quote": "Finally if the provider info is [identified as a multi-Region key](aws-kms-key-arn.md#identifying-an-aws-kms-multi-region-key) the AWS Region MUST be the region from the AWS KMS key in the configured key ids matched to the requested AWS KMS key by using [AWS KMS MRK Match for Decrypt](aws-kms-mrk-match-for-decrypt.md#implementation).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider/get-master-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-mrk-aware-master-key-provider.md",
      "target_section": "get-master-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "An AWS KMS client MUST be obtained by calling the regional client supplier with this AWS Region.\n",
      "id": "33cfc800fdd96ef2",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 103,
      "quote": "An AWS KMS client MUST be obtained by calling the regional client supplier with this AWS Region.",
