      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "To attempt to decrypt a particular [encrypted data key](../structures.md#encrypted-data-key),\nOnDecrypt MUST call [AWS KMS Decrypt](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/APIReference/API_Decrypt.html) with the configured AWS KMS client.\n",
      "id": "d926403cb07c6154",
