      "quote": "To attempt to decrypt a particular [encrypted data key](../structures.md#encrypted-data-key), OnDecrypt MUST call [AWS KMS Decrypt](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/APIReference/API_Decrypt.html) with the configured AWS KMS client.",
