      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- `KeyId`: If the provider info’s resource type is `key` and its resource is a multi-Region key\nthen a new ARN MUST be created where the region part MUST equal the AWS KMS client region\nand every other part MUST equal the provider info.\n",
