      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "When calling [AWS KMS Decrypt](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/APIReference/API_Decrypt.html),\nthe keyring MUST call with a request constructed as follows:\n",
      "id": "991260741a912d1a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 160,
      "quote": "When calling [AWS KMS Decrypt](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/APIReference/API_Decrypt.html), the keyring MUST call with a request constructed as follows:",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-rsa-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
