      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If any decryption succeeds,\nthe result of this decryption MUST be split into\nthe encryption context digest and plaintext data key by:\n",
      "id": "d5de0b1ded1513e4",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 197,
      "quote": "If any decryption succeeds, the result of this decryption MUST be split into the encryption context digest and plaintext data key by:",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-rsa-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-rsa-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST compare the decrypted encryption context digest\nto the encryption context digest prime;\nif the two are not equal,\nthe keyring MUST fail and\nMUST NOT modify the [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials).\n",
      "id": "eae8fd7596a6f182",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 205,
      "quote": "The keyring MUST compare the decrypted encryption context digest to the encryption context digest prime; if the two are not equal, the keyring MUST fail and MUST NOT modify the [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-rsa-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-rsa-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Otherwise, this keyring MUST immediately return the input\n[decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials), modified in the following ways:\n",
      "id": "06e4e65b79c49ef3",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 215,
      "quote": "Otherwise, this keyring MUST immediately return the input [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials), modified in the following ways:",
