      "quote": "If no decryption and keyring digest check succeeds, the keyring MUST fail and MUST NOT modify the [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-rsa-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/aws-kms/aws-kms-rsa-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "OnEncrypt MUST fail if this keyring does not have a specified Public Key.\n",
