    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST determine the [Padding Scheme](#padding-scheme)\nusing the configured [AWS KMS Encryption Algorithm]((https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/APIReference/API_Decrypt.html#KMS-Decrypt-request-EncryptionAlgorithm).\n",
