      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If `RSAES_OAEP_SHA_256` the keyring\nMUST use [OAEP with SHA-256 and MGF1 with SHA-256 Padding](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc8017#section-7.1).\n",
      "id": "b26fc77c5453592a",
