    },
    {
      "comment": "VersionKey MUST first get the active version for the branch key from the keystore\nby calling AWS DDB `GetItem`\nusing the `branch-key-id` as the Partition Key and `\"branch:ACTIVE\"` value as the Sort Key.\n",
      "id": "e2ecf6af244c47a3",
      "level": "Must",
