      "quote": "If the [algorithm suite](algorithm-suites.md) requested contains a [Identity KDF](algorithm-suites.md#identity-kdf), the caching CMM MUST obtain the decryption materials by making a call to the underlying CMM's [Decrypt Materials](cmm-interface.md#decrypt-materials) function.",
