      "quote": "If the caller provides a keyring, then the caching CMM MUST set its underlying CMM to a [default CMM](default-cmm.md) initialized with the keyring.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/initialization.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "initialization",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Finally, the caching CMM MUST optionally accept the following values:\n",
      "id": "f234ea5ca5ed945c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 47,
      "quote": "Finally, the caching CMM MUST optionally accept the following values:",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/initialization.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "initialization",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The maximum number of bytes that MAY be encrypted by a single data key.\n",
      "id": "c37c013cb89219e8",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 11,
      "quote": "The maximum number of bytes that MAY be encrypted by a single data key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/limit-bytes.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "limit-bytes",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If this parameter is not set, the caching CMM MUST set it to a value no more than 2^63-1.\n",
      "id": "794a4adc296607ca",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 17,
      "quote": "If this parameter is not set, the caching CMM MUST set it to a value no more than 2^63-1.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/limit-bytes.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "limit-bytes",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The maximum number of messages that MAY be encrypted by a single data key.\n",
      "id": "293ac613783772fa",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 14,
      "quote": "The maximum number of messages that MAY be encrypted by a single data key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/limit-messages.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "limit-messages",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If this parameter is not set, the caching CMM MUST set it to 2^32.\n",
      "id": "a090333a21de37d5",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 20,
      "quote": "If this parameter is not set, the caching CMM MUST set it to 2^32.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/limit-messages.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "limit-messages",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The caching CMM MUST provide a structure as defined below,\nto track usage statistics.\n",
      "id": "7c9ae94cecbfcaa3",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 26,
      "quote": "The caching CMM MUST provide a structure as defined below, to track usage statistics.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/limit-messages.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "limit-messages",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If this parameter is not set, the caching CMM MUST set a partition ID\nthat uniquely identifies the respective caching CMM.\n",
      "id": "7f3ece812f6d7e60",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 10,
      "quote": "If this parameter is not set, the caching CMM MUST set a partition ID that uniquely identifies the respective caching CMM.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/partition-id.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "partition-id",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The Partition ID MUST NOT be changed after initialization.\n",
      "id": "41301693bb3783e9",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 17,
      "quote": "The Partition ID MUST NOT be changed after initialization.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/partition-id.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "partition-id",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Multiple caching CMMs MAY share the same cryptographic materials cache,\nbut by default MUST NOT use each other's cache entries.\n",
      "id": "4d66d977dfc6f731",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 14,
      "quote": "Multiple caching CMMs MAY share the same cryptographic materials cache, but by default MUST NOT use each other's cache entries.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/underlying-cryptographic-materials-cache.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "underlying-cryptographic-materials-cache",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "When the caching CMM stores encryption materials into the cryptographic materials cache,\nthe caching CMM MUST set the initial usage stats for the cache entry.\n",
      "id": "13b487f95f7228b5",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 16,
      "quote": "When the caching CMM stores encryption materials into the cryptographic materials cache, the caching CMM MUST set the initial usage stats for the cache entry.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/usage-stats.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "usage-stats",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "When the caching CMM obtains encryption materials from the cryptographic materials cache,\nthe caching CMM MUST update the usage stats for the cache entry retrieved.\n",
      "id": "c3497c4922e82485",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 23,
      "quote": "When the caching CMM obtains encryption materials from the cryptographic materials cache, the caching CMM MUST update the usage stats for the cache entry retrieved.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm/usage-stats.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/caching-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "usage-stats",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The CMM Interface MUST support the following behaviors:\n",
      "id": "c450b4c3752c1849",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 10,
      "quote": "The CMM Interface MUST support the following behaviors:",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/behaviors.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "behaviors",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The decrypt materials request MUST include the following:\n",
      "id": "2b1e484a1d1a9e4f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 19,
      "quote": "The decrypt materials request MUST include the following:",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials-request.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials-request",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- The encryption context provided MAY be empty.\n",
      "id": "38fd18e55a52ca70",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 25,
      "quote": "- The encryption context provided MAY be empty.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials-request.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials-request",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The decrypt materials request MAY include the following:\n",
      "id": "31f57d48ddbf02f5",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 31,
      "quote": "The decrypt materials request MAY include the following:",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials-request.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials-request",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "When the CMM gets a [decrypt materials request](#decrypt-materials-request),\nit MUST return [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials) appropriate for the request.\n",
      "id": "d21bad05cf750d1f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 51,
      "quote": "When the CMM gets a [decrypt materials request](#decrypt-materials-request), it MUST return [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials) appropriate for the request.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the requested algorithm suite does not include a signing algorithm but the encryption context includes the reserved `aws-crypto-public-key` key, the operation SHOULD fail.\n",
      "id": "304a20085231bf9c",
      "level": "Should",
      "line": 58,
      "quote": "If the requested algorithm suite does not include a signing algorithm but the encryption context includes the reserved `aws-crypto-public-key` key, the operation SHOULD fail.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Likewise, if the requested algorithm suite includes a signing algorithm but the encryption context does not include the reserved `aws-crypto-public-key` key, the operation SHOULD fail.\n",
      "id": "13261b5092f4e8c3",
      "level": "Should",
      "line": 64,
      "quote": "Likewise, if the requested algorithm suite includes a signing algorithm but the encryption context does not include the reserved `aws-crypto-public-key` key, the operation SHOULD fail.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The CMM MUST validate the [Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context)\nby comparing it to the customer supplied [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context)\nin [decrypt materials request](#decrypt-materials-request).\n",
      "id": "95d3bfa64925e022",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 70,
      "quote": "The CMM MUST validate the [Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context) by comparing it to the customer supplied [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context) in [decrypt materials request](#decrypt-materials-request).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For every key that exists in both [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context)\nand [Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context),\nthe values MUST be equal or the operation MUST fail.\n",
      "id": "da2294919c61c3ba",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 78,
      "quote": "For every key that exists in both [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context) and [Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context), the values MUST be equal or the operation MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The CMM MAY fail if it expects key-value pairs\nthat do not exist in [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context)\non the [decrypt materials request](#decrypt-materials-request).\n",
      "id": "d128937f6f14a69f",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 86,
      "quote": "The CMM MAY fail if it expects key-value pairs that do not exist in [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context) on the [decrypt materials request](#decrypt-materials-request).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The decryption materials returned MUST include the following:\n",
      "id": "4d8bd77ee0f43884",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 94,
      "quote": "The decryption materials returned MUST include the following:",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- The CMM MAY modify the encryption context.\n",
      "id": "b36ef2bfd2ff8968",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 100,
      "quote": "- The CMM MAY modify the encryption context.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cmm-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
