      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- All key-value pairs that exist in [Reproduced Encryption Context](structures.md#encryption-context)\nbut do not exist in encryption context on the [decrypt materials request](#decrypt-materials-request)\nSHOULD be appended to the decryption materials.\n",
      "id": "f64737d07f15a0f8",
