      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/commitment-policy.md",
      "target_section": "supported-format-commitment-policy-enum",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "An implementation SHOULD provide a way to avoid this, for example,\nby spawning a background thread to occasionally remove expired entries.\n",
      "id": "855fc8ff054a9130",
      "level": "Should",
      "line": 12,
      "quote": "An implementation SHOULD provide a way to avoid this, for example, by spawning a background thread to occasionally remove expired entries.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache/background-processing.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "background-processing",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "A cache entry represents an entry in the cryptographic materials cache\nand MUST have the following information.\n",
      "id": "c0bd11ff9d4119f4",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 13,
      "quote": "A cache entry represents an entry in the cryptographic materials cache and MUST have the following information.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache/cache-entry.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "cache-entry",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The CMC MUST validate that the cache entry\nhas not exceeded it's stored [TTL](#time-to-live-ttl).\n",
      "id": "446c749b681498cc",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 18,
      "quote": "The CMC MUST validate that the cache entry has not exceeded it's stored [TTL](#time-to-live-ttl).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache/get-cache-entry.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "get-cache-entry",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- Get Cache Entry MAY return a cache miss when the TTL has net yet been exceeded.\n",
      "id": "d490530f7432f214",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 25,
      "quote": "- Get Cache Entry MAY return a cache miss when the TTL has net yet been exceeded.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache/get-cache-entry.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "get-cache-entry",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
