      "quote": "If used in a multi-threaded context, the next [Get Cache Entry](#get-cache-entry) operation MAY not return the entry just added.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache/put-cache-entry.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "put-cache-entry",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Each cache entry has a time-to-live (TTL)\nthat represents a point in time at which the cache entry\nMUST be considered invalid.\n",
      "id": "3f35e67c5932067a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 17,
      "quote": "Each cache entry has a time-to-live (TTL) that represents a point in time at which the cache entry MUST be considered invalid.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache/time-to-live-ttl.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "time-to-live-ttl",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "After a cache entry's TTL has elapsed,\nwe say that the entry is _TTL-expired_,\nand a CMC MUST NOT return the entry to any caller.\n",
      "id": "826711f024e1a7e3",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 25,
      "quote": "After a cache entry's TTL has elapsed, we say that the entry is _TTL-expired_, and a CMC MUST NOT return the entry to any caller.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache/time-to-live-ttl.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "time-to-live-ttl",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Updating usage metadata SHOULD be atomic.\n",
      "id": "e1c36e5c62c8f9e5",
      "level": "Should",
      "line": 12,
      "quote": "Updating usage metadata SHOULD be atomic.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache/usage-metadata.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "usage-metadata",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The default CMM MUST call its master key provider's\n[Decrypt Data Key](master-key-provider-interface.md#decrypt-data-key) operation.\n",
      "id": "ac95de24c98223ab",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 10,
      "quote": "The default CMM MUST call its master key provider's [Decrypt Data Key](master-key-provider-interface.md#decrypt-data-key) operation.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/decrypt-materials-master-key-provider.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials-master-key-provider",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the algorithm suite contains a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm),\nthe default CMM MUST extract the verification key\nfrom the encryption context under the reserved `aws-crypto-public-key` key.\n",
      "id": "4f31676cc6456d8c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 25,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite contains a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm), the default CMM MUST extract the verification key from the encryption context under the reserved `aws-crypto-public-key` key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If this key is not present in the encryption context, the operation MUST fail\nwithout returning any decryption materials.\n",
      "id": "b000ed5ce11f7383",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 33,
      "quote": "If this key is not present in the encryption context, the operation MUST fail without returning any decryption materials.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the algorithm suite does not contain a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm),\nbut the encryption context includes the reserved `aws-crypto-public-key` key,\nthe operation MUST fail without returning any decryption materials.\n",
      "id": "d34e8e17e5cb2511",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 40,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite does not contain a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm), but the encryption context includes the reserved `aws-crypto-public-key` key, the operation MUST fail without returning any decryption materials.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The request MUST fail if the algorithm suite on the request is not supported by the [commitment policy](./commitment-policy.md#supported-commitment-policy-enum) on the request.\n",
      "id": "48bedceb1b502879",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 48,
      "quote": "The request MUST fail if the algorithm suite on the request is not supported by the [commitment policy](./commitment-policy.md#supported-commitment-policy-enum) on the request.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "On each call to Decrypt Materials,\nthe default CMM MUST make a call to its [keyring's](#keyring)\n[On Decrypt](keyring-interface.md#ondecrypt) operation.\n",
      "id": "19289b0674d0eb0c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 54,
      "quote": "On each call to Decrypt Materials, the default CMM MUST make a call to its [keyring's](#keyring) [On Decrypt](keyring-interface.md#ondecrypt) operation.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The default CMM MUST obtain the Plaintext Data Key from\nthe On Decrypt response and include it in the decrypt\nmaterials returned.\n",
      "id": "abc38feca659df69",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 62,
      "quote": "The default CMM MUST obtain the Plaintext Data Key from the On Decrypt response and include it in the decrypt materials returned.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/decrypt-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The default CMM MUST call its master key provider's\n[Get Master Keys for Encryption](master-key-provider-interface.md#get-master-keys-for-encryption) operation\nto obtain a list of master keys to use.\n",
      "id": "87a822049f7debea",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 21,
      "quote": "The default CMM MUST call its master key provider's [Get Master Keys for Encryption](master-key-provider-interface.md#get-master-keys-for-encryption) operation to obtain a list of master keys to use.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials-master-key-provider.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials-master-key-provider",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the master key provider does not identify which master key MUST generate the data key,\nthe default CMM MUST use the first master key in the list for that purpose.\n",
      "id": "5446719ac584cf22",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 29,
      "quote": "If the master key provider does not identify which master key MUST generate the data key, the default CMM MUST use the first master key in the list for that purpose.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials-master-key-provider.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials-master-key-provider",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The default CMM MUST generate the data key using this master key's\n[Generate Data Key](master-key-interface.md#generate-data-key) operation.\n",
      "id": "8fb3e1eef23c3612",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 36,
      "quote": "The default CMM MUST generate the data key using this master key's [Generate Data Key](master-key-interface.md#generate-data-key) operation.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials-master-key-provider.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials-master-key-provider",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For each remaining master key,\nthe default CMM MUST call the master key's\n[Encrypt Data Key](master-key-interface.md#encrypt-data-key) operation\nwith the plaintext data key.\n",
      "id": "447df9dc307d5626",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 43,
      "quote": "For each remaining master key, the default CMM MUST call the master key's [Encrypt Data Key](master-key-interface.md#encrypt-data-key) operation with the plaintext data key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials-master-key-provider.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials-master-key-provider",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Adding the key `aws-crypto-public-key` SHOULD be done to a copy of the encryption context\nso that the caller's encryption context is not mutated.\n",
      "id": "58321b48b5c8f09c",
      "level": "Should",
      "line": 44,
      "quote": "Adding the key `aws-crypto-public-key` SHOULD be done to a copy of the encryption context so that the caller's encryption context is not mutated.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the encryption context included in the [encryption materials request](cmm-interface.md#encryption-materials-request)\nalready contains the `aws-crypto-public-key` key,\nthis operation MUST fail rather than overwrite the associated value.\n",
      "id": "358cc82e3fbf9b3e",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 51,
      "quote": "If the encryption context included in the [encryption materials request](cmm-interface.md#encryption-materials-request) already contains the `aws-crypto-public-key` key, this operation MUST fail rather than overwrite the associated value.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- If the [encryption materials request](cmm-interface.md#encryption-materials-request) does not contain an algorithm suite,\nthe operation MUST add the default algorithm suite for the [commitment policy](./commitment-policy.md#supported-commitment-policy-enum)\nas the algorithm suite in the encryption materials returned.\n",
      "id": "1d6363d3a5ba9d86",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 59,
      "quote": "- If the [encryption materials request](cmm-interface.md#encryption-materials-request) does not contain an algorithm suite, the operation MUST add the default algorithm suite for the [commitment policy](./commitment-policy.md#supported-commitment-policy-enum) as the algorithm suite in the encryption materials returned.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- If the [encryption materials request](cmm-interface.md#encryption-materials-request) does contain an algorithm suite,\nthe request MUST fail if the algorithm suite is not supported by the [commitment policy](./commitment-policy.md#supported-commitment-policy-enum) on the request.\n",
      "id": "9f22cbc6a81ce0bb",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 67,
      "quote": "- If the [encryption materials request](cmm-interface.md#encryption-materials-request) does contain an algorithm suite, the request MUST fail if the algorithm suite is not supported by the [commitment policy](./commitment-policy.md#supported-commitment-policy-enum) on the request.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- If the [encryption materials request](cmm-interface.md#encryption-materials-request) does contain an algorithm suite,\nthe encryption materials returned MUST contain the same algorithm suite.\n",
      "id": "fd3d19e203fa020b",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 74,
      "quote": "- If the [encryption materials request](cmm-interface.md#encryption-materials-request) does contain an algorithm suite, the encryption materials returned MUST contain the same algorithm suite.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the algorithm suite contains a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm),\nthe default CMM MUST Generate a [signing key](structures.md#signing-key).\n",
      "id": "15e409adb0065a77",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 81,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite contains a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm), the default CMM MUST Generate a [signing key](structures.md#signing-key).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the algorithm suite contains a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm),\nthe default CMM MUST Add the key-value pair of\nkey `aws-crypto-public-key`,\nvalue `base64-encoded public verification key`\nto the [encryption context](structures.md#encryption-context).\n",
      "id": "3ae18ac753951fdc",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 88,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite contains a [signing algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#signature-algorithm), the default CMM MUST Add the key-value pair of key `aws-crypto-public-key`, value `base64-encoded public verification key` to the [encryption context](structures.md#encryption-context).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "On each call to Get Encryption Materials,\nthe default CMM MUST make a call to its [keyring's](#keyring)\n[On Encrypt](keyring-interface.md#onencrypt) operation.\n",
      "id": "761341a5aeb0216d",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 98,
      "quote": "On each call to Get Encryption Materials, the default CMM MUST make a call to its [keyring's](#keyring) [On Encrypt](keyring-interface.md#onencrypt) operation.",
