      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The default CMM MUST obtain the Plaintext Data Key from the\nOn Encrypt Response and include it in the\n[encryption materials](structures.md#encryption-materials) returned.\n",
      "id": "d937b96b4c17b9c9",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 106,
      "quote": "The default CMM MUST obtain the Plaintext Data Key from the On Encrypt Response and include it in the [encryption materials](structures.md#encryption-materials) returned.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm/get-encryption-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/default-cmm.md",
      "target_section": "get-encryption-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
