      "level": "Must",
      "line": 43,
      "quote": "- If the public key is not DER-encoded the keyring MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas/ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas.md",
      "target_section": "ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "This schema can only encrypt data and MUST NOT be used\nfor decryption.\n",
      "id": "d489aa967802e2ec",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 49,
      "quote": "This schema can only encrypt data and MUST NOT be used for decryption.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas/ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas.md",
      "target_section": "ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If used on decrypt, the keyring MUST fail.\n",
      "id": "eec16d3fa0c54ac0",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 56,
      "quote": "If used on decrypt, the keyring MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas/ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas.md",
      "target_section": "ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The recipient's public key MAY belong to a KMS key.\n",
      "id": "e465a38a99241e13",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 62,
      "quote": "The recipient's public key MAY belong to a KMS key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas/ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas.md",
      "target_section": "ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- MUST generate a new ECC key pair along the same EC curve as\nthe recipient's public key.\n",
      "id": "6d3d6182fcdb1a39",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 68,
      "quote": "- MUST generate a new ECC key pair along the same EC curve as the recipient's public key.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas/ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas.md",
      "target_section": "ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the keyring is not able to generate a\nnew ECC key pair, the keyring MUST fail.\n",
      "id": "f074ea3ca563f163",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 75,
      "quote": "If the keyring is not able to generate a new ECC key pair, the keyring MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/key-agreement-schemas/ephemeralprivatekeytostaticpublickey.toml",
