    },
    {
      "comment": "On initialization, if the keyring is not configured with\na sender public key, the keyring MUST call\n`kms:GetPublicKey` on the sender's configured KMS key ID.\n",
      "id": "60895c922e49c5a1",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 75,
      "quote": "On initialization, if the keyring is not configured with a sender public key, the keyring MUST call `kms:GetPublicKey` on the sender's configured KMS key ID.",
