      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/keyring-interface.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-data-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials) do not include a plaintext data key,\nOnDecrypt MUST decrypt a data key.\n",
