      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- The [authentication tag length](#authentication-tag-length) obtained from the key provider information MUST have a value equal to the length specified by this keyring's [wrapping algorithm](#wrapping-algorithm).\n",
      "id": "15ead21ae82c9984",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 117,
      "quote": "- The [authentication tag length](#authentication-tag-length) obtained from the key provider information MUST have a value equal to the length specified by this keyring's [wrapping algorithm](#wrapping-algorithm).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- It MUST use the [encrypt key](#encrypted-key) obtained from deserialization as the AES-GCM input ciphertext.\n",
