      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- It MUST use the serialized [encryption context](structures.md#encryption-context-1) as the AES-GCM AAD.\n",
      "id": "b00abfd09a43bff5",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 147,
