      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a decryption succeeds, this keyring MUST\nadd the resulting plaintext data key to the decryption materials and return the modified materials.\n",
      "id": "bd5d716e47512e34",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 153,
      "quote": "If a decryption succeeds, this keyring MUST add the resulting plaintext data key to the decryption materials and return the modified materials.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If no decryption succeeds,\nthe keyring MUST fail\nand MUST NOT modify the [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials).\n",
      "id": "036561043b99a492",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 160,
      "quote": "If no decryption succeeds, the keyring MUST fail and MUST NOT modify the [decryption materials](structures.md#decryption-materials).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring/ondecrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "ondecrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "OnEncrypt MUST take [encryption materials](structures.md#encryption-materials) as input.\n",
      "id": "06ff26b333b96e2c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 38,
      "quote": "OnEncrypt MUST take [encryption materials](structures.md#encryption-materials) as input.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the [encryption materials](structures.md#encryption-materials) do not contain a plaintext data key,\nOnEncrypt MUST generate a random plaintext data key and set it on the [encryption materials](structures.md#encryption-materials).\n",
      "id": "569179ebe42ff6b3",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 44,
      "quote": "If the [encryption materials](structures.md#encryption-materials) do not contain a plaintext data key, OnEncrypt MUST generate a random plaintext data key and set it on the [encryption materials](structures.md#encryption-materials).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST encrypt the plaintext data key in the [encryption materials](structures.md#encryption-materials)\nusing AES-GCM.\n",
      "id": "64460d412803ee91",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 51,
      "quote": "The keyring MUST encrypt the plaintext data key in the [encryption materials](structures.md#encryption-materials) using AES-GCM.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The keyring MUST attempt to serialize the [encryption materials'](structures.md#encryption-materials)\n[encryption context](structures.md#encryption-context-1) according to the [encryption context serialization specification](structures.md#serialization).\n",
      "id": "4645926021a93b0a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 58,
      "quote": "The keyring MUST attempt to serialize the [encryption materials'](structures.md#encryption-materials) [encryption context](structures.md#encryption-context-1) according to the [encryption context serialization specification](structures.md#serialization).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring/onencrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/raw-aes-keyring.md",
      "target_section": "onencrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
