    },
    {
      "comment": "On initialization, the keyring MUST assert that the recipient's public key\nand the sender's private key belong to the same ECC Curve, and that\nthe public key's ECC points are not the \"points at infinity\".\n",
      "id": "c4218cd3a1c9e7c0",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 30,
