      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The raw RSA keyring SHOULD support loading PEM encoded [PKCS #8 PrivateKeyInfo structures](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5958#section-2)\nas private keys.\n",
      "id": "a6e36c9c6da2d4ff",
      "level": "Should",
      "line": 18,
      "quote": "The raw RSA keyring SHOULD support loading PEM encoded [PKCS #8 PrivateKeyInfo structures](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5958#section-2) as private keys.",
