    {
      "comment": "This structure MAY include the following fields:\n",
      "id": "caf974261cf40d0f",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 26,
      "quote": "This structure MAY include the following fields:",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/structure-4.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "structure-4",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "This specification uses the terms \"encrypt\" and \"decrypt\" for simplicity,\nbut the actual process by which a key provider obtains the plaintext data key from the ciphertext\nand vice versa MAY be any reversible operation, though we expect that most will use encryption.\n",
      "id": "53a76a1012283b08",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 17,
      "quote": "This specification uses the terms \"encrypt\" and \"decrypt\" for simplicity, but the actual process by which a key provider obtains the plaintext data key from the ciphertext and vice versa MAY be any reversible operation, though we expect that most will use encryption.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/structure.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "structure",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the algorithm suite does not contain a symmetric signing algorithm,\nthe symmetric signing key MUST NOT be included in the materials.\n",
      "id": "472305b7e8dfbea0",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 19,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite does not contain a symmetric signing algorithm, the symmetric signing key MUST NOT be included in the materials.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/symmetric-signing-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "symmetric-signing-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the algorithm suite does contain a symmetric signing algorithm,\nthe symmetric signing key MUST also be included in the materials\nif and only if the materials also include a [plaintext data key](#plaintext-data-key-1).\n",
      "id": "317b723ab11a7ec2",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 26,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite does contain a symmetric signing algorithm, the symmetric signing key MUST also be included in the materials if and only if the materials also include a [plaintext data key](#plaintext-data-key-1).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/symmetric-signing-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "symmetric-signing-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If included, the symmetric signature key MUST fit the specification for the [symmetric signature algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#symmetric-signature-algorithm)\nincluded in this decryption material's [algorithm suite](#algorithm-suite-1).\n",
      "id": "9fe5d0731c71cb07",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 34,
      "quote": "If included, the symmetric signature key MUST fit the specification for the [symmetric signature algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#symmetric-signature-algorithm) included in this decryption material's [algorithm suite](#algorithm-suite-1).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/symmetric-signing-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "symmetric-signing-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "This value MUST be kept secret.\n",
      "id": "73ebb31d37a0d4d3",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 41,
      "quote": "This value MUST be kept secret.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/symmetric-signing-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "symmetric-signing-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the algorithm suite does not contain a symmetric signing algorithm, this list MUST NOT be included in the materials.\n",
      "id": "0a0ed3425685ae42",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 16,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite does not contain a symmetric signing algorithm, this list MUST NOT be included in the materials.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/symmetric-signing-keys.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "symmetric-signing-keys",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the algorithm suite does contain a symmetric signing algorithm, this list MUST have length equal to the [encrypted data key list](#encrypted-data-keys).\n",
      "id": "ddd49c642297ad67",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 22,
      "quote": "If the algorithm suite does contain a symmetric signing algorithm, this list MUST have length equal to the [encrypted data key list](#encrypted-data-keys).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/symmetric-signing-keys.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "symmetric-signing-keys",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The symmetric signature keys MUST adhere to the specification for [symmetric signature algorithms](./algorithm-suites.md#symmetric-signature-algorithm)\nincluded in this encryption material's [algorithm suite](#algorithm-suite).\n",
      "id": "9ee94665e8dfbb81",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 28,
      "quote": "The symmetric signature keys MUST adhere to the specification for [symmetric signature algorithms](./algorithm-suites.md#symmetric-signature-algorithm) included in this encryption material's [algorithm suite](#algorithm-suite).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/symmetric-signing-keys.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "symmetric-signing-keys",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The value of keys in this list MUST be kept secret.\n",
      "id": "05ea58adf90b86fb",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 35,
      "quote": "The value of keys in this list MUST be kept secret.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/symmetric-signing-keys.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "symmetric-signing-keys",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The verification key MUST fit the specification for the [asymmetric signature algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#asymmetric-signature-algorithm)\nincluded in this decryption material's [algorithm suite](#algorithm-suite-1).\n",
      "id": "57cd51713367de0f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 10,
      "quote": "The verification key MUST fit the specification for the [asymmetric signature algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#asymmetric-signature-algorithm) included in this decryption material's [algorithm suite](#algorithm-suite-1).",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures/verification-key.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md",
      "target_section": "verification-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "All behaviors MUST be exactly the same as a [Local CMC](local-cryptographic-materials-cache.md),\neven if used in a multi-threaded context.\n",
      "id": "b2fac799e6e221b8",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 8,
      "quote": "All behaviors MUST be exactly the same as a [Local CMC](local-cryptographic-materials-cache.md), even if used in a multi-threaded context.",
      "source": "compliance/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/synchronized-local-cryptographic-materials-cache/behaviors.toml",
      "target_path": "aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/synchronized-local-cryptographic-materials-cache.md",
      "target_section": "behaviors",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "On initialization of the synchronized local CMC,\nthe caller MUST provide exactly what is required by a\n[Local CMC](local-cryptographic-materials-cache.md).\n",
      "id": "c6ca319cc94e1f5a",
      "level": "Must",
