    },
    {
      "comment": "- If there is no salt length defined for the [algorithm suite encryption key derivation commitment setting](#algorithm-suites-encryption-key-derivation-settings),\nthe the salt MUST be a byte sequence of 0 as long as the hash length in bytes.\n",
      "id": "857af0a7e5fc60e4",
