                "text": "  "
              },
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "0ce3f9c2175e30b5"
                ],
                "status_id": 3,
                "text": "or a signal for the AWS SDK to select the default region."
              }
            ],
            "- The input list of AWS KMS grant tokens",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "083b64a3e10193cd",
                  "9d8ee79f4eeb37a2"
                ],
                "status_id": 16,
                "text": "NOTE: The AWS Encryption SDK SHOULD NOT attempt to evaluate its own default region."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "2a85c8a3bf02523f",
                  "8dd01344b98b4b5c"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "Then a [Multi-Keyring](../multi-keyring.md#inputs) MUST be initialize by using this generator keyring as the [generator keyring](../multi-keyring.md#generator-keyring) and this set of child keyrings as the [child keyrings](../multi-keyring.md#child-keyrings)."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "ac3c42f8c5b07feb",
                  "82fc7573cb6f23cb"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "This Multi-Keyring MUST be this function's output."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "6c47f16566d22727",
