          "title": "Structure"
        },
        {
          "id": "algorithm-suite",
          "lines": [
            "The [algorithm suite](algorithm-suites.md) to be used for [encryption](../client-apis/encrypt.md)."
          ],
          "title": "Algorithm Suite"
        },
        {
          "id": "encrypted-data-keys",
          "lines": [
            "A list of the [encrypted data keys](#encrypted-data-key) that correspond to the plaintext data key.",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "c9acf485ab94cf89",
                  "ecf20a98e02829d4"
                ],
                "status_id": 13,
                "text": "The [ciphertext](#ciphertext) of each encrypted data key in this list MUST be an opaque form of the"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "c9acf485ab94cf89",
                  "ecf20a98e02829d4"
                ],
                "status_id": 13,
                "text": "plaintext data key from this set of encryption materials."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "2f5fa686cf12caea",
                  "933377f26143b3cb"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "If the plaintext data key is not included in this set of encryption materials, this list MUST be empty."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "ecf20a98e02829d4",
            "ecf20a98e02829d4",
            "933377f26143b3cb"
          ],
          "title": "Encrypted Data Keys"
        },
        {
          "id": "encryption-context-1",
          "lines": [
            "The [encryption context](#encryption-context) associated with this [encryption](../client-apis/encrypt.md).",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "47d44625518203fc",
                  "fe27e5048c15b6c7"
                ],
                "status_id": 16,
                "text": "If an [encryption material](#encryption-materials) contains a [signing key](#signing-key),"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "47d44625518203fc",
                  "fe27e5048c15b6c7"
                ],
                "status_id": 16,
                "text": "the [encryption context](#encryption-context) SHOULD include the reserved key `aws-crypto-public-key`."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "c12eefa60b4ae421",
                  "2bd7ba8acec01217"
                ],
                "status_id": 16,
                "text": "The mapped value from the reserved key `aws-crypto-public-key` SHOULD be the signature verification key"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "c12eefa60b4ae421",
                  "2bd7ba8acec01217"
                ],
                "status_id": 16,
                "text": "corresponding to the [signing key](#signing-key) stored on the [encryption material](#encryption-materials)."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "22c534e3399e1666",
                  "001233378de66aae"
                ],
                "status_id": 16,
                "text": "If an [encryption material](#encryption-materials) does not contains a [signing key](#signing-key),"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "22c534e3399e1666",
                  "001233378de66aae"
                ],
                "status_id": 16,
                "text": "the [encryption context](#encryption-context) SHOULD NOT include the reserved key `aws-crypto-public-key`."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "fe27e5048c15b6c7",
            "fe27e5048c15b6c7",
            "2bd7ba8acec01217",
            "2bd7ba8acec01217",
            "001233378de66aae",
            "001233378de66aae"
          ],
          "title": "Encryption Context"
        },
        {
          "id": "plaintext-data-key",
          "lines": [
            "A data key to be used as input for [encryption](../client-apis/encrypt.md).",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "1e9ad8018b622f2a",
                  "da37c541b46224ac"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "The plaintext data key MUST:"
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "1e9ad8018b622f2a"
                ],
                "status_id": 2,
                "text": "- Fit the specification for the [key derivation algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#key-derivation-algorithm)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [],
                "status_id": 0,
                "text": "  "
              },
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "1e9ad8018b622f2a"
                ],
                "status_id": 2,
                "text": "included in this decryption material's [algorithm suite](#algorithm-suite)."
              }
            ],
            "- Consist of cryptographically secure (pseudo-)random bits.",
            "- Be kept secret.",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "2b7a848d40b3e387",
                  "471782e2c23b66a9"
                ],
                "status_id": 15,
                "text": "The plaintext data key SHOULD be stored as immutable data."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "f4a27281f57c677a",
                  "547e8a97ba7689aa"
                ],
                "status_id": 15,
                "text": "The plaintext data key SHOULD offer an interface to zero the plaintext data key."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "da37c541b46224ac",
            "471782e2c23b66a9",
            "547e8a97ba7689aa"
          ],
          "title": "Plaintext Data Key"
        },
        {
          "id": "signing-key",
          "lines": [
            "The key to be used as the signing key for asymmetric signature verification during [encryption](../client-apis/encrypt.md).",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "ecf53347355b703d",
                  "b3f8f9748be03b34"
                ],
                "status_id": 13,
                "text": "The signing key MUST fit the specification described by the [asymmetric signature algorithm](algorithm-suites.md#asymmetric-signature-algorithm)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "ecf53347355b703d",
                  "b3f8f9748be03b34"
                ],
                "status_id": 13,
                "text": "included in this encryption material's [algorithm suite](#algorithm-suite)."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8caca511749e1383",
                  "ed0a8b16bc23512e"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "If the algorithm suite does not contain an asymmetric signing algorithm, the signing key MUST NOT be present."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "14b5012bd8828218",
                  "a7254946db8d3704"
                ],
                "status_id": 13,
                "text": "The value of this key MUST be kept secret."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "b3f8f9748be03b34",
            "b3f8f9748be03b34",
            "ed0a8b16bc23512e",
            "a7254946db8d3704"
          ],
          "title": "Signing Key"
        },
        {
          "id": "required-encryption-context-keys",
          "lines": [
            "Communicates to higher level `encrypt` APIs",
            "of [supported formats](algorithm-suites.md#supp#supported-formats)",
            "how to split the encryption context",
            "into elements that are authenticated and stored",
            "from elements that are only authenticated and not stored.",
            "Keys in this set should not be stored",
            "with ciphertext protected by these materials.",
            "These keys are required to be reproduced on decrypt.",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "ab9806995cea91a7",
                  "ed8f726af06ad945"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "Every key in Required Encryption Context Keys"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "ab9806995cea91a7",
                  "ed8f726af06ad945"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "MUST be a key in the [encryption context](#encryption-context-1)."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "ed8f726af06ad945",
            "ed8f726af06ad945"
          ],
          "title": "Required Encryption Context Keys"
        },
        {
          "id": "symmetric-signing-keys",
          "lines": [
            "A list of symmetric signing keys, such that each key in this list corresponds to the encrypted data key in the [encrypted data key list](#encrypted-data-keys) at the same index.",
            "These keys are used to generate symmetric signatures during encryption.",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "341d8e97437f55af",
                  "0a0ed3425685ae42"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "If the algorithm suite does not contain a symmetric signing algorithm, this list MUST NOT be included in the materials."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "efc2221c96ec63d9",
                  "ddd49c642297ad67"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "If the algorithm suite does contain a symmetric signing algorithm, this list MUST have length equal to the [encrypted data key list](#encrypted-data-keys)."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9ee94665e8dfbb81"
                ],
                "status_id": 3,
                "text": "The symmetric signature keys MUST adhere to the specification for [symmetric signature algorithms](./algorithm-suites.md#symmetric-signature-algorithm)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9ee94665e8dfbb81"
                ],
                "status_id": 3,
                "text": "included in this encryption material's [algorithm suite](#algorithm-suite)."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "e4e2d0d09fce5137",
                  "05ea58adf90b86fb"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "The value of keys in this list MUST be kept secret."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "0a0ed3425685ae42",
            "ddd49c642297ad67",
            "9ee94665e8dfbb81",
            "9ee94665e8dfbb81",
            "05ea58adf90b86fb"
          ],
          "title": "Symmetric Signing Keys"
        },
